OL,3,GNEWSANurse says relatives 'swept away'
OL,4,Ain Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse said his relatives had been
OL,7,F"swept away" by the deadly flash floods
OL,8,Fnear the Nepal-Tibet border.
OL,10,F"My wife's auntie and uncle, and their
OL,11,Fgranddaughter and her husband are
OL,12,Fmissing, and my godson as well," said
OL,13,FRajendra Pudasaini, who works at the
OL,14,FPrincess Alexandra Hospital in Harlow,
OL,15,FEssex.
OL,17,FMore than 30 British nationals are
OL,18,Famong hundreds of people missing and
OL,19,Ffeared dead as rescue efforts continue
OL,20,Fin the Rasuwa district following the
OL,21,Ffloods and landslides on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
