OL,3,GNEWSANurse says relatives 'swept away'
OL,4,Ain Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FPudasaini, who is president of the
OL,7,FNon-Resident Nepali Association UK,
OL,8,Fadded: "The town and the villages were
OL,9,Fswept away; it's a tragic thing."
